{"html":"<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/assets/prospect-lockup-dark.png\"/><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><div class=\"nav\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Prospect home\"><img src=\"/assets/prospect-lockup-dark.png\" width=\"138\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Prospect\"/></a><nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><a href=\"#product\">Product</a><a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a href=\"#about\">About</a><a href=\"mailto:founder@prospectpartnership.co.uk\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"nav-cta-wrap\" style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block\"><div class=\"\" style=\"will-change:transform\"><a class=\"btn btn-solid btn-sm\" href=\"#waitlist\">Get early access <span class=\"btn-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\"><div class=\"hero-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"threads-container\"><canvas class=\"threads-canvas\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas></div></div><div class=\"hero-inner wrap\"><p class=\"pill reveal\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Early access · Waitlist now open</p><h1 id=\"hero-title\">AI for<!-- --> <br/>the trader.</h1><p class=\"lede reveal\">Describe a strategy idea. Prospect is being built to turn it into rules, test it honestly and watch your risk. <strong>Join the waitlist for a chance to be selected as a beta tester, and refer friends to move up the list.</strong></p><div class=\"reveal hero-form\"><form id=\"waitlist-form\" class=\"waitlist\" action=\"/api/waitlist\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"sr-only\" for=\"email\">Email address</label><div class=\"field\"><input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" maxLength=\"254\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" aria-describedby=\"privacy-note form-status\" name=\"email\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-solid submit\"><span>Join the waitlist</span><span class=\"btn-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div><div class=\"honeypot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"website\">Leave this field empty</label><input id=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autoComplete=\"off\" name=\"website\"/></div><label class=\"consent\" for=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"consent\" required=\"\" name=\"consent\"/><span>I agree to receive emails about Prospect’s launch and early access. I can withdraw consent at any time by emailing Prospect.</span></label><p class=\"fine\" id=\"privacy-note\">Read our <a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy notice</a>. Beta places are limited and not guaranteed.</p><div id=\"form-status\" class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" tabindex=\"-1\"></div><noscript><p class=\"fine\">JavaScript is required to submit this form. You can <a href=\"mailto:founder@prospectpartnership.co.uk\">contact the founder</a> for help.</p></noscript></form><ul class=\"perks\"><li><svg class=\"perk-tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 8.5l3 3 7-7\"></path></svg>A chance to be selected as a beta tester</li><li><svg class=\"perk-tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 8.5l3 3 7-7\"></path></svg>Refer friends to move up the list</li><li><svg class=\"perk-tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 8.5l3 3 7-7\"></path></svg>Launch news only. No spam, no trading credentials</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"hero-foot wrap reveal\"><span>Built for independent minds</span><div class=\"marquee\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Retail traders, prop traders, systematic thinkers</span><div class=\"marquee-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Retail traders <i>/</i> Prop traders <i>/</i> Systematic thinkers <i>/</i> </span><span>Retail traders <i>/</i> Prop traders <i>/</i> Systematic thinkers <i>/</i> </span><span>Retail traders <i>/</i> Prop traders <i>/</i> Systematic thinkers <i>/</i> </span><span>Retail traders <i>/</i> Prop traders <i>/</i> Systematic thinkers <i>/</i> </span></div></div><a class=\"scroll-cue\" href=\"#manifesto\" aria-label=\"Scroll to learn more\"><span></span></a></div></section><section class=\"manifesto wrap\" id=\"manifesto\" aria-label=\"Our principles\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Our position</p><h2 class=\"scroll-reveal \" aria-label=\"Retail traders have been sold signals, bots and screenshots. Prospect is being built around process, evidence and risk.\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-text manifesto-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">Retail</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">traders</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">have</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">been</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">sold</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">signals,</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">bots</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">and</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">screenshots.</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">Prospect</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">is</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">being</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">built</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">around</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">process,</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">evidence</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">and</span></span> <span class=\"scroll-reveal-word\"><span class=\"scroll-reveal-piece\">risk.</span></span></span></h2></section><section id=\"product\" class=\"section product\"><div class=\"wrap section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">The platform</p><h2>A first look at what we’re building.</h2></div><p>These are genuine prototype screens from the Prospect workspace. Waitlist members are first to see what comes next.</p></div><div class=\"wrap frame-stage\"><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"frame-bar\"><span class=\"frame-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Product preview</span><span class=\"tag\">In development</span></div><img id=\"product-screen\" class=\"frame-shot\" src=\"/assets/product/workspace.jpg\" width=\"1440\" height=\"971\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Prospect prototype home. Create or import a strategy, with no portfolio connected.\"/></div></div><div class=\"wrap preview-controls\"><div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Select a product preview\"><button type=\"button\" data-preview=\"home\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Your workspace</button><button type=\"button\" data-preview=\"builder\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Strategy Builder</button></div><div class=\"preview-copy\" aria-live=\"polite\"><h3 id=\"preview-title\">A workspace for what’s next.</h3><p id=\"preview-copy\">Start with a strategy idea or bring your existing research. This is a prototype preview, not the released product.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"section how\"><div class=\"wrap section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</p><h2>From first idea to the whole portfolio.</h2></div><p>One connected workflow, with AI at each step and your judgement at the end of it. <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/trading-strategy-backtesting/\">What a backtest can tell you →</a></p></div><div class=\"wrap steps-pin\"><ol class=\"step-rail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><li class=\"is-active\"><span>0<!-- -->1</span>Build</li><li class=\"\"><span>0<!-- -->2</span>Research</li><li class=\"\"><span>0<!-- -->3</span>Understand</li><li class=\"\"><span>0<!-- -->4</span>Monitor</li><li class=\"\"><span>0<!-- -->5</span>Manage</li></ol><div class=\"step-stack\"><article class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-copy\"><p class=\"kicker\"><span>0<!-- -->1</span> <!-- -->Build</p><h3>Describe it. Prospect drafts the rules.</h3><p>Explain a strategy in plain language. Prospect is being designed to work out the rules itself — when to get in, when to get out, how much to risk — and lay them out for you to read and question.</p><p class=\"tag\">In development</p></div><div class=\"step-visual\"><figure class=\"ill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"You describe an idea in plain language; Prospect drafts the full rule set for you to review.\"><rect class=\"ill-card\" x=\"30\" y=\"28\" width=\"220\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\"></rect><text class=\"ill-text\" x=\"52\" y=\"55\">“Trend after a breakout”</text><path class=\"ill-accent draw\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M140 76 C140 104 200 100 200 128\"></path><circle class=\"ill-dot pop\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"128\" r=\"4\"></circle><rect class=\"ill-card ill-card-strong\" x=\"90\" y=\"140\" width=\"280\" height=\"132\" rx=\"16\"></rect><text class=\"ill-label\" x=\"112\" y=\"168\">PROSPECT DRAFTS</text><g class=\"pop\"><circle class=\"ill-tick\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"194\" r=\"8\"></circle><path class=\"ill-tick-mark\" d=\"M116 194l3 3 5-6\"></path><text class=\"ill-text\" x=\"138\" y=\"199\">Rules</text><rect class=\"ill-skeleton\" x=\"240\" y=\"190\" width=\"90\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\"></rect></g><g class=\"pop\"><circle class=\"ill-tick\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"220\" r=\"8\"></circle><path class=\"ill-tick-mark\" d=\"M116 220l3 3 5-6\"></path><text class=\"ill-text\" x=\"138\" y=\"225\">Sizing</text><rect class=\"ill-skeleton\" x=\"240\" y=\"216\" width=\"72\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\"></rect></g><g class=\"pop\"><circle class=\"ill-tick\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"246\" r=\"8\"></circle><path class=\"ill-tick-mark\" d=\"M116 246l3 3 5-6\"></path><text class=\"ill-text\" x=\"138\" y=\"251\">Risk limits</text><rect class=\"ill-skeleton\" x=\"240\" y=\"242\" width=\"54\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\"></rect></g></svg><figcaption>Concept illustration · no market data</figcaption></figure></div></article><article class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-copy\"><p class=\"kicker\"><span>0<!-- -->2</span> <!-- -->Research</p><h3>Question the evidence.</h3><p>Explore historical behaviour with costs, spreads and slippage in view, and data held back for checking. A backtest is evidence to investigate, never a promise of future returns.</p><p class=\"tag\">In development</p></div><div class=\"step-visual\"><figure class=\"ill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Historical behaviour shown with a cost band and a hold-out period kept back for checking.\"><path class=\"ill-grid\" d=\"M30 250H370M30 190H370M30 130H370M30 70H370\"></path><path class=\"ill-band draw-fill\" d=\"M30.0 154.0L44.8 132.8L59.6 122.2L74.3 125.7L89.1 137.2L103.9 146.6L118.7 147.2L133.5 141.2L148.3 137.0L163.0 143.0L177.8 160.1L192.6 180.5L207.4 192.8L222.2 190.1L237.0 174.9L251.7 157.2L266.5 147.1L281.3 147.5L296.1 152.7L310.9 153.4L325.7 144.4L340.4 129.3L355.2 118.0L370.0 119.6L370.0 147.6L355.2 146.0L340.4 157.3L325.7 172.4L310.9 181.4L296.1 180.7L281.3 175.5L266.5 175.1L251.7 185.2L237.0 202.9L222.2 218.1L207.4 220.8L192.6 208.5L177.8 188.1L163.0 171.0L148.3 165.0L133.5 169.2L118.7 175.2L103.9 174.6L89.1 165.2L74.3 153.7L59.6 150.2L44.8 160.8L30.0 182.0Z\"></path><path class=\"ill-line draw\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M30.0 168.0L44.8 146.8L59.6 136.2L74.3 139.7L89.1 151.2L103.9 160.6L118.7 161.2L133.5 155.2L148.3 151.0L163.0 157.0L177.8 174.1L192.6 194.5L207.4 206.8L222.2 204.1L237.0 188.9L251.7 171.2L266.5 161.1L281.3 161.5L296.1 166.7L310.9 167.4L325.7 158.4L340.4 143.3L355.2 132.0L370.0 133.6\"></path><path class=\"ill-divider\" d=\"M280 40V262\"></path><text class=\"ill-label\" x=\"292\" y=\"56\">HOLD-OUT</text><text class=\"ill-label\" x=\"40\" y=\"56\">AFTER COSTS &amp; SLIPPAGE</text></svg><figcaption>Concept illustration · no market data</figcaption></figure></div></article><article class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-copy\"><p class=\"kicker\"><span>0<!-- -->3</span> <!-- -->Understand</p><h3>See what a result can really tell you.</h3><p>Enough trades? Which market conditions did it need? Does it survive small changes? Prospect is being built to surface the questions that matter before you trust a number.</p><p class=\"tag\">In development</p></div><div class=\"step-visual\"><figure class=\"ill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three robustness questions: sample size, dependence on market conditions and sensitivity to small changes.\"><g><text class=\"ill-text\" x=\"40\" y=\"76\">Enough trades?</text><rect class=\"ill-track\" x=\"40\" y=\"92\" width=\"320\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"></rect><rect class=\"ill-fill grow\" x=\"40\" y=\"92\" width=\"249.60000000000002\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"></rect></g><g><text class=\"ill-text\" x=\"40\" y=\"154\">Needs one regime?</text><rect class=\"ill-track\" x=\"40\" y=\"170\" width=\"320\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"></rect><rect class=\"ill-fill grow ill-warn\" x=\"40\" y=\"170\" width=\"134.4\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"></rect></g><g><text class=\"ill-text\" x=\"40\" y=\"232\">Survives small changes?</text><rect class=\"ill-track\" x=\"40\" y=\"248\" width=\"320\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"></rect><rect class=\"ill-fill grow\" x=\"40\" y=\"248\" width=\"195.2\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"></rect></g></svg><figcaption>Concept illustration · no market data</figcaption></figure></div></article><article class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-copy\"><p class=\"kicker\"><span>0<!-- -->4</span> <!-- -->Monitor</p><h3>Notice when behaviour changes.</h3><p>Record what you expect before the market answers. Prospect is being built to flag when live behaviour drifts from your thesis, so you can take a closer look.</p><p class=\"tag\">In development</p></div><div class=\"step-visual\"><figure class=\"ill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Live behaviour drifting outside the expected range, flagged for review.\"><path class=\"ill-band\" d=\"M30.0 114.0L41.7 105.4L53.4 98.9L65.2 96.0L76.9 97.6L88.6 103.2L100.3 111.5L112.1 120.3L123.8 127.6L135.5 131.6L147.2 131.3L159.0 126.7L170.7 119.0L182.4 110.1L194.1 102.2L205.9 97.1L217.6 96.2L229.3 99.6L241.0 106.6L252.8 115.4L264.5 123.8L276.2 129.8L287.9 132.0L299.7 129.8L311.4 123.7L323.1 115.2L334.8 106.4L346.6 99.5L358.3 96.2L370.0 97.2L370.0 149.2L358.3 148.2L346.6 151.5L334.8 158.4L323.1 167.2L311.4 175.7L299.7 181.8L287.9 184.0L276.2 181.8L264.5 175.8L252.8 167.4L241.0 158.6L229.3 151.6L217.6 148.2L205.9 149.1L194.1 154.2L182.4 162.1L170.7 171.0L159.0 178.7L147.2 183.3L135.5 183.6L123.8 179.6L112.1 172.3L100.3 163.5L88.6 155.2L76.9 149.6L65.2 148.0L53.4 150.9L41.7 157.4L30.0 166.0Z\"></path><path class=\"ill-grid-dash\" d=\"M30.0 140.0L41.7 131.4L53.4 124.9L65.2 122.0L76.9 123.6L88.6 129.2L100.3 137.5L112.1 146.3L123.8 153.6L135.5 157.6L147.2 157.3L159.0 152.7L170.7 145.0L182.4 136.1L194.1 128.2L205.9 123.1L217.6 122.2L229.3 125.6L241.0 132.6L252.8 141.4L264.5 149.8L276.2 155.8L287.9 158.0L299.7 155.8L311.4 149.7L323.1 141.2L334.8 132.4L346.6 125.5L358.3 122.2L370.0 123.2\"></path><path class=\"ill-line draw\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M30.0 140.0L41.7 140.3L53.4 122.6L65.2 113.7L76.9 128.1L88.6 136.4L100.3 131.2L112.1 140.8L123.8 161.4L135.5 161.2L147.2 148.6L159.0 151.4L170.7 154.0L182.4 135.2L194.1 119.4L205.9 126.3L217.6 130.1L229.3 120.4L241.0 126.0L252.8 148.3L264.5 152.4L276.2 163.2L287.9 171.5L299.7 176.6L311.4 178.7L323.1 179.4L334.8 180.6L346.6 184.4L358.3 192.4L370.0 205.4\"></path><circle class=\"ill-ring pop\" cx=\"334.82758620689657\" cy=\"180.58966719849602\" r=\"13\"></circle><circle class=\"ill-dot pop\" cx=\"334.82758620689657\" cy=\"180.58966719849602\" r=\"4\"></circle><rect class=\"ill-card ill-card-strong pop\" x=\"162.82758620689657\" y=\"202.58966719849602\" width=\"134\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\"></rect><text class=\"ill-text pop\" x=\"180.82758620689657\" y=\"224.58966719849602\">Flag for review</text><text class=\"ill-label\" x=\"40\" y=\"62\">EXPECTED RANGE</text></svg><figcaption>Concept illustration · no market data</figcaption></figure></div></article><article class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-copy\"><p class=\"kicker\"><span>0<!-- -->5</span> <!-- -->Manage</p><h3>See risk across every strategy.</h3><p>Strategies that look different can share the same exposure. See correlation, concentration and overlap across your whole portfolio in one view.</p><p class=\"tag\">In development</p></div><div class=\"step-visual\"><figure class=\"ill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A correlation grid across five strategies, highlighting three that share the same exposure.\"><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"50\" y=\"36\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.83\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"96\" y=\"36\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.68\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"142\" y=\"36\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.6049999999999999\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"188\" y=\"36\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.15500000000000003\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"234\" y=\"36\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.23000000000000004\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"50\" y=\"82\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.68\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"96\" y=\"82\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.83\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"142\" y=\"82\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.6425\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"188\" y=\"82\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.1925\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"234\" y=\"82\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.15500000000000003\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"50\" y=\"128\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.6049999999999999\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"96\" y=\"128\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.6425\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"142\" y=\"128\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.83\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"188\" y=\"128\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.23000000000000004\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"234\" y=\"128\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.2675\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"50\" y=\"174\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.15500000000000003\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"96\" y=\"174\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.1925\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"142\" y=\"174\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.23000000000000004\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"188\" y=\"174\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.83\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"234\" y=\"174\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.305\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"50\" y=\"220\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.23000000000000004\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"96\" y=\"220\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.15500000000000003\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"142\" y=\"220\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.2675\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"188\" y=\"220\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.305\"></rect><rect class=\"cell pop\" x=\"234\" y=\"220\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" rx=\"8\" fill-opacity=\"0.83\"></rect><rect class=\"ill-outline draw-box\" x=\"46\" y=\"32\" width=\"146\" height=\"146\" rx=\"11\"></rect><path class=\"ill-accent draw\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M196 105 H286\"></path><text class=\"ill-label\" x=\"296\" y=\"101\">SHARED</text><text class=\"ill-label\" x=\"296\" y=\"119\">EXPOSURE</text></svg><figcaption>Concept illustration · no market data</figcaption></figure></div></article></div></div><div class=\"wrap mid-cta\"><p>Want to be first to try it?</p><div class=\"\" style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block\"><div class=\"\" style=\"will-change:transform\"><a class=\"btn btn-solid btn-lg\" href=\"#waitlist\">Join the waitlist <span class=\"btn-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"section founder\"><div class=\"wrap founder-grid\"><figure class=\"portrait-wrap\"><div class=\"portrait\"><img src=\"/assets/fred-boxer.jpg\" width=\"509\" height=\"637\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Fred Boxer, founder of Prospect\"/></div><figcaption><span>Fred Boxer</span><span>Founder, Prospect</span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"founder-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">From the founder</p><h2>Better tools for independent minds.</h2><p class=\"reveal big\">Fred Boxer founded Prospect after independently building and operating systematic trading systems with AI-assisted development.</p><p class=\"reveal\">Prospect is being built around a simple ambition: make sophisticated strategy development and trading intelligence accessible to independent traders. Exploring an idea should not begin with a wall of technical complexity.</p><p class=\"reveal\">We’re still building. If that’s a future you’d like to help shape, join the waitlist and come along.</p><div class=\"signature reveal\"><div>Fred Boxer<span>Founder · Prospect</span></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/fred-boxer-93025a388/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Connect on LinkedIn →</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"waitlist\" class=\"closing\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"closing-card\"><div class=\"closing-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"dark-veil-container\"><canvas class=\"dark-veil-canvas\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas></div></div><div class=\"closing-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The waitlist</p><h2>Get in early.</h2><p>Waitlist members get a chance to be selected as Prospect’s first beta testers. After you join you’ll get a personal link: every friend who signs up with it moves you up the list.</p></div><div class=\"closing-form\"><form id=\"waitlist-form-end\" class=\"waitlist\" action=\"/api/waitlist\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"sr-only\" for=\"email-end\">Email address</label><div class=\"field\"><input type=\"email\" id=\"email-end\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" maxLength=\"254\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" aria-describedby=\"privacy-note-end form-status-end\" name=\"email\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-solid submit\"><span>Join the waitlist</span><span class=\"btn-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div><div class=\"honeypot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"website-end\">Leave this field empty</label><input id=\"website-end\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autoComplete=\"off\" name=\"website\"/></div><label class=\"consent\" for=\"consent-end\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"consent-end\" required=\"\" name=\"consent\"/><span>I agree to receive emails about Prospect’s launch and early access. I can withdraw consent at any time by emailing Prospect.</span></label><p class=\"fine\" id=\"privacy-note-end\">Read our <a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy notice</a>. Beta places are limited and not guaranteed.</p><div id=\"form-status-end\" class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" tabindex=\"-1\"></div><noscript><p class=\"fine\">JavaScript is required to submit this form. You can <a href=\"mailto:founder@prospectpartnership.co.uk\">contact the founder</a> for help.</p></noscript></form></div><ol class=\"benefits\"><li><span>0<!-- -->1</span>A chance to be selected as a beta tester</li><li><span>0<!-- -->2</span>Refer friends to move up the list</li><li><span>0<!-- -->3</span>Launch news only. No spam, no trading credentials</li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq-section\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\"><div class=\"wrap faq-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</p><h2 id=\"faq-title\">A few good questions.</h2><p class=\"faq-contact\">Something else? <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"mailto:founder@prospectpartnership.co.uk\">Email the founder →</a></p></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Can I use Prospect today?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Prospect is pre-launch. The screens on this page are prototype previews. Join the waitlist to receive launch and early-access information; registration does not guarantee beta access or a launch date.</p></div></details><details><summary>Will Prospect trade for me?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>No. Prospect is being developed for strategy research and trading intelligence. This website does not offer autonomous trading, brokerage execution or fund management.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do I need to know how to code?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>The AI-assisted builder aims to make strategy development accessible through natural language. It is still in development; supported workflows and their limitations will be explained at launch.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does backtesting prove a strategy will work?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>No. Historical tests depend on data quality, costs and assumptions. Overfitting and changing market conditions can make results misleading. Trading can result in losses.</p></div></details><details><summary>What do I get by joining the waitlist?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Emails about Prospect’s launch and early access, and a chance to be selected as one of our first beta testers. We never ask for trading credentials, holdings or financial information, and you can withdraw consent at any time.</p></div></details><details><summary>How do referrals work?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>After joining you get a personal link. Every person who joins the waitlist through it moves you further up the list, and beta invitations go to the top of the list first. Selection is not guaranteed, and the number of beta places is limited.</p></div></details></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><p class=\"footer-tag\">Sophisticated trading intelligence, made accessible.</p><nav class=\"footer-col\" aria-label=\"Explore\"><p class=\"footer-label\">Explore</p><a href=\"#product\">The product</a><a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a href=\"#about\">Meet the founder</a><a href=\"/insights/\">Research essentials</a><a href=\"#waitlist\">Join the waitlist</a></nav><nav class=\"footer-col\" aria-label=\"Company\"><p class=\"footer-label\">Company</p><a href=\"mailto:founder@prospectpartnership.co.uk\">Email Prospect</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/fred-boxer-93025a388/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fred Boxer on LinkedIn</a><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy notice</a><a href=\"/terms/\">Website terms</a><a href=\"/accessibility/\">Accessibility</a><a href=\"/cookies/\">Cookies</a></nav></div><p class=\"wordmark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>P</span><span>r</span><span>o</span><span>s</span><span>p</span><span>e</span><span>c</span><span>t</span></p><div class=\"legal\"><p>© 2026 Prospect Partnership Ltd · Company No. 15277481 · England &amp; Wales</p><p>Prospect is pre-launch and under development. Product previews show the current prototype, not a released service. Trading involves risk of loss. Historical testing does not predict future results. Nothing on this website is investment advice. Prospect does not execute trades or move your funds.</p></div></div></footer><div class=\"grain\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>","faqs":[["Can I use Prospect today?","Prospect is pre-launch. The screens on this page are prototype previews. Join the waitlist to receive launch and early-access information; registration does not guarantee beta access or a launch date."],["Will Prospect trade for me?","No. Prospect is being developed for strategy research and trading intelligence. This website does not offer autonomous trading, brokerage execution or fund management."],["Do I need to know how to code?","The AI-assisted builder aims to make strategy development accessible through natural language. It is still in development; supported workflows and their limitations will be explained at launch."],["Does backtesting prove a strategy will work?","No. Historical tests depend on data quality, costs and assumptions. Overfitting and changing market conditions can make results misleading. Trading can result in losses."],["What do I get by joining the waitlist?","Emails about Prospect’s launch and early access, and a chance to be selected as one of our first beta testers. We never ask for trading credentials, holdings or financial information, and you can withdraw consent at any time."],["How do referrals work?","After joining you get a personal link. Every person who joins the waitlist through it moves you further up the list, and beta invitations go to the top of the list first. Selection is not guaranteed, and the number of beta places is limited."]],"script":"/assets/home/assets/main-hDWTAXxP.js","styles":["/assets/home/assets/main-DkFJWhjm.css"]}